> important of them?

The months (some of which can't be entered in jbovlaste because of a bug in 
vlatai): ianvari, frebuari, martio, prilio, madjio, djunio, djulio, avgusto, 
septembero, oktobero, novmbero, decmbero.

Foods: agbakate, alba'aka, altamru, alzaitu, articoka/xarcufu, birkoku, 
brokoli (brukobli), bromeli/grutrxananase, cidjrburito, djoguro, fiprgado, 
flaume, fragari, glefino, ge(n)jrdauko/ka'orta/morkovi, 
jerjelino/simsimu/xonxoli, kapsiku, kolbasa, mandioka, persika, rutrmango, 
salmone, sardina, spageti.

Plants: a'orne/arce, alga, arnika, bromeli, dzizani, filcina, iedra, jglandi, 
junkace, junpero, kartamo, lorvera, ma'agni, me'andi, mlaluka, sailce, 
tcandana, urci, vandula, vraike.

Animals: alpaka, amniota, ansoptera (laxsfani), antilope, arxokuna/prokioni 
(lumge'u), bakrto, braxiura, cionmau, ckankua, ckinoje, dinsauru, djaguara, 
djirafa, dorkada, falkoni, foldota, guakmaio, igvana, jboia, jbonobo, kalmari, 
kanguru, karkaju, kokcinela, marmota, miptera, moptera, nerfopi, odbenu, 
odnata, oktopoda/oxtapodi, rangutano, salmone, sargueia, skargolu, takside, 
tcimpazi, trixexo/trixexu, visnda, xarjngiri/xarjnjiri.

Ethnic groups, religions, regionalities, and nationalities: berbero, bolgaro, 
ckiptare, islenska, mraigo, noxtino, pangaio, po'olska, sfe'ero, skalduna, 
slovako, slovino, suomne, tirkce, tokpona, tsalagi, xalsixa, xelveto, zimbabu.

Materials: alminiu, anmonia, ckabrkacia, furfuru, jinmrtitani, kanvasa.

Other: aftobuso/sorpeka, bitkoine, braibe, cantaje, caxmati, crenzue, 
dinkrnite, fraktali, gredile, ionti, ipka/ipkota, irci, ketlete, klamburi, 
korpora, lerldjamo, metfora, protoni, spontane, taifnu, torceli (magmiltre), 
tsunami, u'imla.

